{{Quote|We're the most powerful being in the universe. We change the very nature of space and time.|[[Serena]].<ref name="X=B+2">''[[X = Ben + 2]]''</ref>}}
'''Alien X''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Celestialsapien (Classic)|Celestialsapien]]<ref name="Bell">[[Bellicus]]</ref><ref name="TFoC" /> from the [[Forge of Creation]].<ref>[[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max Tennyson]]</ref><ref name="TFoC" />

==Appearance==
Alien X is a humanoid alien whose entire body is solid black, excluding his hands, which are white. He has tiny white star-like spots all over his body, giving him the appearance of a starry night sky. His eyes are green and lack pupils, and his forehead bears three horn-like protrusions.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Alien X is largely the same as before, but with minor changes. His chin is now bigger, his body is more muscular, his horns are smaller, and the stars on his body are brighter than before.

Alien X wears the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]]/[[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]]/[[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on his chest.

==Personality==
[[File:SLaTfAtS (574).png|thumb|Bellicus, Serena, and Ben, the three personalities of Alien X]]
{{Quote|"We are one of the most powerful beings in the universe."<br>"Because ''we'' are the most deliberative."|Serena and Bellicus.<ref name="X=B+2" />}}
Alien X has three personalities: [[Serena]], the "voice of love and compassion", [[Bellicus]], the "voice of rage and aggression", and [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]], the "voice of reason".<ref name="X=B+2" /> All three of these voices combine to form Alien X's speech. Otherwise, Alien X is silent. The only things he will say are what he will be doing - what Ben, Bellicus, and Serena have agreed to do.

As Serena and Bellicus have been arguing for eternity and before they had no tiebreaker, getting them to focus on any present task is difficult at best. This leaves Alien X's body trapped in place until an agreement is made.

