Alien X is able to warp reality, time, and space with ease and at any level he wishes.{{Refn|group = note|name = omnipotence}} Even his thoughts can become real. In short, Alien X can do anything,<ref name=Azmuth>[[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]]</ref><ref name="TFoC"/> such as creating and recreating an entire universe at will.<ref name="SLaTfAtS">''[[So Long, and Thanks for All the Smoothies]]''</ref>

Alien X is nearly invulnerable, as he was completely unharmed when the [[Annihilarrgh]] destroyed the universe around him.<ref name="SLaTfAtS" /> This is because the Annihilarrgh affected only [[Universe (Classic)|the universe]]. As for [[Celestialsapien (Classic)|Celestialsapien]]s, rather than being born out of the universe, they are entities separate from it.<ref name="TFoC" /> Alien X is also capable of containing the explosion of an Annihilarrgh, demonstrated by Skurd when he used Alien X's DNA to create an arm for Ben's aliens to contain the big bang.<ref name="AND">''[[A New Dawn]]''</ref>{{Refn|Following his reversion from [[Chromastone (Classic)|Chromastone]], [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] is depicted without a Celestialsapien arm formed by [[Skurd]]. This persists through the mass transformation sequence, which is also missing Skurd. After [[Feedback]] reverts back to Ben, he has a Celestialsapien arm (now on the opposite side), which a shot makes a point to show Skurd reverting. Due to the rushed production of Season 8 of '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''',{{Refn|[[:File:Rath Clothed Permanent 2.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Skurd Development Details.png]]|group = DJW|name = production}} as well as the logistical cost of making new model sheets for aliens with a Celestialsapien arm and Skurd, it is assumed that both were present despite not being seen on-screen, and the Celestialsapien arm was likely a contributing factor towards Feedback's ability to contain and redirect the [[Annihilarrgh]]'s energy. Furthermore, when inquired about the shot, neither story editor [[Charlotte McDuffie]] or director [[Dan Riba]] recalled the intention.{{Refn|https://youtu.be/unaX1hKhOy4|group = CM}}|group = note}}

Alien X can create time waves to reverse events in a specific area<ref name="X=B+2" /> and energy vortexes to suck in other beings such as another Celestialsapien.<ref name="UvT" />

Alien X possesses telekinesis and mind control. He also is capable of deflecting energy attacks, such as those generated by a [[Prypiatosian-B]].<ref>''[[Weapon XI: Part 1]]''</ref>

Alien X has the ability to shapeshift, teleport, generate force fields and alter his size; these feats were demonstrated by the [[Galactic Gladiator]].<ref name="UvT" /> Alien X is also capable of self-duplication.<ref name="UvT" />

Alien X can regenerate his limbs should they be severed,{{Refn|[[:File:Unseen Alien X Abilities.png]]|group = DJW|name= abilities}} as demonstrated by the Galactic Gladiator.<ref name="UvT" />

Alien X can levitate and fly at high speeds.<ref name="TFoC" /><ref name="UvT" />

Alien X possesses superhuman strength, being able to effortlessly destroy large planets.<ref name="UvT">''[[Universe vs. Tennyson]]''</ref>

Alien X can survive in the vacuum of space.<ref name="UvT" /> Additionally, his body is rigid, as no outside force except for other Celestialsapiens can make it move.<ref name="X=B+2" /><ref name="UvT" />

Alien X is capable of effortlessly piercing through the [[Contumelia]]'s extradimensional field.<ref name="AND" /> Alien X is also capable of generating miniature black holes, as demonstrated by [[Atomic-X]].<ref name="ATTWB">''[[And Then There Was Ben]]''</ref>{{Refn|[[:File:Atomic-X Black Holes.png]]|group = TNP}}

Alien X can see through objects, such as a mountain.{{Refn|group = DJW|name= abilities}}

==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
UVT (234).png|Opposing Personalities
TFOC84.1.png|Reverted by Professor Paradox
</gallery>
{{Quote|"His duel consciousness must deliberate and reach an agreement before Alien X can do anything."<br>"How long will that take?"<br>"Eternity, give or take a few eons."|[[Starbeard]] and [[Rook Blonko|Rook]].<ref name="UvT" />}}
In order for Alien X to perform any action, including simple movement and transforming back, all three of his personalities must agree to do so.{{Refn|In '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Ben served as the tiebreaker for Alien X's personalities. If two of the personalities agreed on something, the motion was carried.<ref name="X=B+2" /><ref name="TFoC"/> From ''[[So Long, and Thanks for All the Smoothies]]'' onwards, all three have to agree.{{Refn|group = BTP|name = retcons}}|group = note}} This has proven to be a major weakness, as [[Serena]] and [[Bellicus]] were not interested in dealing with present affairs and wanted to finish past ones that were not possible to deal with without [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]. In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Ben still needs to consult Bellicus and Serena to get control, he is just better at it now.{{Refn|[[:File:Alien X Doesn't Have Full Control.PNG]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Still Needs to Consult.png]]|group = DJW}}

Alien X's reality warping capabilities have a limit, as Alien X was unable to reverse the destruction of the [[Universe (Classic)|universe]] caused by the [[Annihilarrgh]],<ref name="Bell" /><ref>[[Serena]]</ref> which forced Ben to remake the universe instead.<ref name="SLaTfAtS"/> Alien X's powers also may either be limited to the basic cosmic laws of other universes or may not work depending on the universe.{{Refn|[[:File:Limitation of Alien X in other realities.png]]|group = DJW}} It also depends on whether his internal astronomy is compatible enough with the universe he's in.{{Refn|[[:File:Alien X in Other Universes.png]]|group = DJW}}

Alien X's actions onto reality can be neutralized and reversed by the intervention of other [[Celestialsapien (Classic)|Celestialsapien]]s.<ref name="UvT" />{{Refn|group=MoA|name=Thread|[[Thread:339773]]}}

Alien X cannot manipulate [[manna]] directly because he would first have to alter the [[Universe (Classic)|universe]] to change the nature of manna.{{Refn|[[:File:Celestialsapiens and Manna.PNG]]|group = MW}}

Alien X's cosmic powers do not work well against [[Magic (Classic)|magic]] and a magic [[Spells (Classic)|spell]] could cancel his powers.{{Refn|[[:File:Celestialsapiens powers don't work right on magic.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Alien X Omnipotence Cancel Spell.png]]|group = DJW}}

Ben can be forced to revert back from Alien X by [[Professor Paradox]]<ref name="TFoC" /> and the [[DNA Scanner]].{{Refn|[[:File:DNA Scanner Can Work on Alien X.png]]|group = DJW}}

Alien X is vulnerable to having his powers absorbed by [[Osmosian]]s<ref name="Azmuth" /><ref name="TFoC" /> and entities with similar powers such as [[Michael Morningstar (Classic)|Darkstar]].<ref>[[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]]</ref><ref>''[[Darkstar Rising]]''</ref>

Alien X's life force can be drained by a [[Vladat]].{{Refn|[[:File:Whampire Celestialsapien.PNG]]|group = DJW}} He also cannot survive on [[Anur Vladias]].{{Refn|[[:File:What Anur Vladias used to be like.png]]|group = DJW}}

Alien X can be affected by a [[Nemuina]]'s sleeping dust.{{Refn|[[:File:Celestialsapiens Sleeping Dust.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

Alien X's personalities can be scared by [[Toepick]]'s [[Toepick's Species|species]].{{Refn|[[:File:Toepick Can Scare Celestialsapien Personalities.png]]|group = DJW}}

{{Cite|However, any of Alien X's weaknesses can be negated by Alien X deciding so.}}

==History==
===Alien Force===
*Alien X first appeared in ''[[X = Ben + 2]]'', where he stopped a flood caused by a broken dam. After much fruitless arguing, [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] convinces [[Serena]] and [[Bellicus]] to transform him into another alien (mostly by insulting them). Ben swore that he won't use Alien X again, as it is not worth the price.
**The same scene reoccurred in a flashback in ''[[The Ultimate Enemy: Part 2]]''.

===Ultimate Alien===
*In ''[[The Forge of Creation]]'', [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] half-heartedly turned into Alien X in hopes of learning the location of the [[Forge of Creation]] from [[Bellicus]] and [[Serena]] to no avail until [[Professor Paradox]] suddenly appeared. Bellicus and Serena almost came to a vote in having Paradox destroyed for being within 500 light-years of a [[Celestialsapien (Classic)|Celestialsapien]] before he reverted Alien X.

===Omniverse===
*In ''[[So Long, and Thanks for All the Smoothies]]'', Alien X was unable to stop the [[Annihilarrgh]] from destroying the universe. Fortunately, [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] managed to convince [[Bellicus]] and [[Serena]] to recreate a near-identical copy.
*In ''[[Universe vs. Tennyson]]'', Alien X defeated the [[Galactic Gladiator]], winning the trial for recreating the universe.
*In ''[[Weapon XI: Part 1]]'', Alien X battled the [[Rooters]] and the [[Servantis|brainwashed]] [[Amalgam Kids]].
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', [[Skurd]] used Alien X's DNA to create a sword for [[Chromastone (Classic)|Chromastone]], which managed to pierce the Annihilarrgh's barrier. Later, Alien X appeared for a short time when Ben was cycling through his aliens.

===Alternate Timeline===
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', Negative Alien X was mentioned by [[Professor Paradox]] when speaking of an alternate timeline in which [[Albedo]] turned into said transformation and was trapped motionless for nearly a year.

