Alien X appears in the game, but only in the cutscenes for the Xbox 360, Wii, PS2, and PSP versions. He is not a playable alien, being replaced by [[Cannonbolt (Classic)|Cannonbolt]] or [[Upchuck|Murk Upchuck]] in the DS version.

